     These functions, as well as ccaapp__nneett__lliimmiitt(), are reentrant but not
     thread-safe.  That is, they may be called from separate threads only with
     different _c_a_p___c_h_a_n_n_e_l___t arguments or with synchronization.

LLIIMMIITTSS
     By default, the cap_net capability provides unrestricted access to the
     network namespace.  Applications typically only require access to a small
     portion of the network namespace: The ccaapp__nneett__lliimmiitt() function can be
     used to restrict access to the network.  The ccaapp__nneett__lliimmiitt__iinniitt() returns
     an opaque limit handle used to store a list of capabilities.  The _m_o_d_e
     restricts the functionality of the service.  Modes are encoded using the
     following flags:

           CAPNET_ADDR2NAME                reverse DNS lookups are allowed with
                                           cap_getnameinfo
           CAPNET_NAME2ADDR                name resolution is allowed with
                                           cap_getaddrinfo
           CAPNET_DEPRECATED_ADDR2NAME     reverse DNS lookups are allowed with
                                           cap_gethostbyaddr
           CAPNET_DEPRECATED_NAME2ADDR     name resolution is allowed with
                                           cap_gethostbyname and cap_gethostbyname2
           CAPNET_BIND                     bind syscall is allowed
           CAPNET_CONNECT                  connect syscall is allowed
           CAPNET_CONNECTDNS               connect syscall is allowed to the values
                                           returned from previous call to
                                           the cap_getaddrinfo or cap_gethostbyname

     ccaapp__nneett__lliimmiitt__aaddddrr22nnaammee__ffaammiillyy() limits the ccaapp__ggeettnnaammeeiinnffoo() and
     ccaapp__ggeetthhoossttbbyyaaddddrr() to do reverse DNS lookups to specific family
     (AF_INET, AF_INET6, etc.)

     ccaapp__nneett__lliimmiitt__aaddddrr22nnaammee() limits the ccaapp__ggeettnnaammeeiinnffoo() and
     ccaapp__ggeetthhoossttbbyyaaddddrr() to do reverse DNS lookups only on those specific
     structures.

     ccaapp__nneett__lliimmiitt__nnaammee22aaddddrr__ffaammiillyy() limits the ccaapp__ggeettaaddddrriinnffoo(),
     ccaapp__ggeetthhoossttbbyynnaammee() and ccaapp__ggeetthhoossttbbyynnaammee22() to do the name resolution on
